# Microsoft Graph service-account credentials for the daily email report.
# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values (the same app registration as
# A13-MedlinePBO). .env is gitignored; never commit real secrets.
TENANT_ID=your-tenant-id-here
CLIENT_ID=your-client-id-here
CLIENT_SECRET=your-client-secret-here

# After filling CLIENT_SECRET above, run:
#   python first_time_setup.py          # saves E0_SECRET_PASSPHRASE and hashes the secret
# which rewrites CLIENT_SECRET into an encrypted, at-rest-safe line, e.g.:
#   CLIENT_SECRET_HASHED=enc::....
# notify.load_secrets decrypts CLIENT_SECRET_HASHED at runtime using the
# E0_SECRET_PASSPHRASE environment variable.
